,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":10,"usage":{"completion_tokens":99,"prompt_tokens":6925}},{"content":"Yes, I can follow your instructions and perform actions on my phone. Please let me know what you’d like me to do first.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:11.782233","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":11,"usage":{"completion_tokens":29,"prompt_tokens":2503}},{"content":"Great! Let’s start by checking your phone’s network status and data connection, since MMS requires both cellular service and mobile data.\n\nPlease check your phone’s status bar and let me know:\n- Do you see any signal bars (indicating cellular service)?\n- Is there a “4G”, “5G”, “LTE”, or similar icon (indicating mobile data is active)?\n- Is Airplane Mode enabled (an airplane icon)?\n\nIf you’re unsure, I can guide you to check your network status in your phone’s settings. Let me know what you see, or if you’d like step-by-step instructions.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:13.450830","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":12,"usage":{"completion_tokens":127,"prompt_tokens":7057}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:14.163095","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_FTWuKLUDLWv4X3Koagvs4yrw","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":13,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2663}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:14.163431","tool_call_id":"call_FTWuKLUDLWv4X3Koagvs4yrw","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":14,"usage":null},{"content":"Here’s what I see on my phone’s status bar:\n- There are some signal bars, but the signal is poor.\n- It shows “2G” (no 4G, 5G, or LTE icon).\n- Mobile data appears to be disabled.\n- Airplane Mode is not enabled.\n\nWhat should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:15.634135","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":70,"prompt_tokens":2703}},{"content":"Thank you for the details. Here’s what we need to address:\n\n1. MMS requires at least a 3G network (2G is not sufficient).\n2. Mobile data must be enabled for MMS to work.\n\nLet’s do the following steps:\n\nStep 1: Please enable mobile data on your phone.\nStep 2: After enabling mobile data, change your network mode preference to allow 3G, 4G, or 5G (if available). Look for an option like “Preferred network type” or “Network mode” in your phone’s settings, and select “4G/3G/2G (auto connect)” or “4G/5G preferred.”\n\nOnce you’ve done both steps, let me know if you see a 3G, 4G, or 5G icon in your status bar and if mobile data is now enabled. If you need help with these steps, let me know your phone model and I can provide more specific instructions.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:17.886616","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":203,"prompt_tokens":7258}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:18.709830","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_jF7rCLEveBNkiyjmQ8JdVQoP","name":"toggle_data","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":11,"prompt_tokens":2980}},{"content":"Mobile Data is now ON.\nStatus Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:18.710357","tool_call_id":"call_jF7rCLEveBNkiyjmQ8JdVQoP","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":18,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:19.608404","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"mode":"4g_5g_preferred"},"id":"call_horhVWABWhY06HWEBMrmBrKn","name":"set_network_mode_preference","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":24,"prompt_tokens":3024}},{"content":"Preferred Network Mode set to: 4g_5g_preferred\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:19.608794","tool_call_id":"call_horhVWABWhY06HWEBMrmBrKn","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":20,"usage":null},{"content":"I’ve enabled mobile data and changed the network mode to prefer 4G/5G. Now, my status bar shows excellent signal strength, “5G,” and mobile data is enabled.\n\nWhat should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:20.734072","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":47,"prompt_tokens":3095}},{"content":"Perfect! Now that you have excellent signal strength, “5G” connectivity, and mobile data enabled, please try sending an MMS message again using your messaging app.\n\nLet me know if the MMS sends successfully or if you still encounter any issues. If it doesn’t work, please describe any error message you receive, and I’ll guide you through the next troubleshooting steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:21.911742","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":22,"usage":{"completion_tokens":76,"prompt_tokens":7512}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:22.897977","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_gwxYh7FdqrYJ1vEfymOWmjEf","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":23,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3222}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:22.898331","tool_call_id":"call_gwxYh7FdqrYJ1vEfymOWmjEf","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":24,"usage":null},{"content":"I just tried to send an MMS message, but it still isn’t working. My messaging app says it can’t send MMS messages. There’s no specific error message, just that it can’t send. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:24.049861","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":49,"prompt_tokens":3250}},{"content":"Thank you for letting me know. Since your network and data are now set up correctly, the next most common cause is an issue with your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings, which are required for MMS.\n\nPlease follow these steps:\n1. Go to your phone’s settings and find the “Mobile Network” or “Cellular Network” section.\n2. Look for “Access Point Names” (APN).\n3. Check if there is an option to “Reset to default” or “Reset APN settings.” Please select this option to reset your APN settings.\n\nAfter resetting your APN settings, you must reboot (restart) your phone for the changes to take effect.\n\nOnce your phone has restarted, try sending an MMS message again. Let me know if this resolves the issue or if you still have trouble sending MMS.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:26.385250","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":26,"usage":{"completion_tokens":172,"prompt_tokens":7641}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:27.221745","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_gp9KMXAFY1w4R34fItNN0POF","name":"reset_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":27,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3475}},{"content":"APN settings will reset at reboot.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T18:12:27.222316","tool_call_id":"call_gp9KMXAFY1w4R34fItNN0POF","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":28,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requesto